legend-lite
Copyright 2026 Legend Contributors

legend-lite is a clean-sheet implementation of the FINOS Legend platform's Pure language, its compiler and its
query engine: designed and written anew, not derived from upstream's code. It takes FINOS Legend's legend-pure
(https://github.com/finos/legend-pure) and legend-engine (https://github.com/finos/legend-engine) as its
specification -- their grammar, typing rules, semantics and observable behaviour -- and tests itself against their
published test suites and against answers recorded from them. Its debt to both is the whole of what it implements.

